6. **Dimensionality reduction**: PCA (appropriate for single clean batch, no scVI needed)
7. **Clustering**: Leiden resolution 1.0 → 9 clusters
8. **Annotation**: CellTypist (fine model) with coarse model as second opinion, cross-validated with canonical markers for all 8 final cell types (B cells, CD4/CD8 T cells, NK cells, classical/non-classical monocytes, DCs, platelets) — all confirmed, no relabeling needed

